    "skyPreset": "golden_alpine_meadow",
    "loreSummary": "The only ground on Brightfall anyone has walked, and the only surveyed region in the whole world with a hand-pinned canon place standing on it \u2014 one of forty. The Leap is why hulls know the isle at all. What a party comes ashore for is behind it: the cloud forest, which is the majority of this region and the only forest on the isle that is not overtopped by bare rock, and the broken rock the massif drops down the talus into reach."
